      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T11:33:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fast pair devices still advertise their data (but encrypted) in the background after it\u0027s linked to an account. Which means, the freshness check task would keep alive as long as a user is using a fast pair device. Would this be too aggressive?",
